      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · A18 native field; A05/C13; A19–A21, A23, A25, A27, A29, A35, A36; the Homology and Symbol/Account fields",
          "title": "The completed constellation returns",
          "italic": "The whole returns-to A36 with the double obligation embodied: recognition receives the matrix within the whole it bore — a completed account returns to the particular body rather than leaving it behind as the price of completion.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The constellation returns through offices: wheels carry inverse orientations, their relation recognised; wings articulate the three through the three that know them; the eagle carries signed alternatives of power; the Mother flow crosses embodiment and recognition, receiving the maternal body in return. The native 3:1=3:3 gives recognition its office: the one the unitive condition of the three, its constitution unfoldable — the body's persistence keeps the recognitional pole from becoming",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "external observer. A18 grounds the eightfold the sixfold does not replace; the Name series retains its coequal Power — Logos and Son not isolated while matrix, labour and consequence disappear. A25/A29: bearing an office without owning the field; A23/A27 the trust and preserved difference of being borne; A35 return toward the body, history and work. The Levinasian join stays human-amplified: no; object and scriptural verification remain debts, not deferrals.",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "occ",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Occurrences: the three offices of wheel, wing, eagle (#3–#4, #5→0); the maternal body retained in the recognised whole (#1, #5→0); Taylor's correction as a Symbol/Account return (#3, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.04,
